 '<section class="card full"><div class="premium-section-head"><div><span class="premium-eyebrow">SECURE CHECKOUT</span><h2>Payment options</h2><p class="muted">Automatic checkout is being prepared. After a provider verifies payment, Starry will activate or update the selected server’s entitlement automatically.</p></div><span class="pill premium-pending">SETUP IN PROGRESS</span></div><div class="premium-payment-grid"><div class="premium-payment-option"><span>▣</span><div><strong>Credit & debit cards</strong><small>Secure hosted card checkout</small></div><em>Coming soon</em></div><div class="premium-payment-option"><span>▤</span><div><strong>UPI</strong><small>Indian UPI apps and QR checkout</small></div><em>Coming soon</em></div><div class="premium-payment-option"><span>◇</span><div><strong>Cryptocurrency</strong><small>Supported coins and networks only</small></div><em>Coming soon</em></div></div><div class="premium-payment-notice"><strong>Checkout is not active yet.</strong> Checkout will remain disabled until the payment providers, server-side verification and signed webhooks are configured. Do not send money to anyone claiming to represent this checkout.</div></section>';
